Use `<%- bin %> chat …` for messaging, `<%- bin %> agent …` for self-introspection, `<%- bin %> daemon …` for read-only daemon status/doctor, `<%- bin %> github …` and `<%- bin %> gitlab …` for provider-specific entity attention, `<%- bin %> tree read` for explicit-Team BYO task snapshots, `<%- bin %> tree write` for clean BYO write preflight, `<%- bin %> tree review` for trusted Context Reviewer App publication, `<%- bin %> tree verify` for Context Tree validation, and `<%- bin %> tree tree` for hierarchy browsing.
